 "title": "LHOMEL Double Flax gravel build",
 "body_html": "<meta charset=\"UTF-8\"> <meta content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" name=\"viewport\"> Bamboo Bike Build Interview\n<style><!--\n        body {\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin: 20px;\n        }\n        .question {\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n        .answer {\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n    \n--></style>\n<p><strong>What made you decide to build a bamboo bike?</strong></p>\n<div class=\"interview\">\n<div class=\"answer\">\"I chose bamboo because it's a natural material and easier to work with compared to others.\"</div>\n<div class=\"question\">Did you enjoy building the bicycle from scratch and would you recommend the experience?</div>\n<div class=\"answer\">\"Yes, it was a great experience. I definitely recommend it to others.\"</div>\n<div class=\"question\">What did you find most difficult about your bike build?</div>\n<div class=\"answer\">\"Sanding was the most challenging part.\"</div>\n<div class=\"question\">What was the easiest part of the build?</div>\n<div class=\"answer\">\"Wrapping the connections was the easiest.\"</div>\n<div class=\"question\">How would you describe the ride of your finished bike?</div>\n<div class=\"answer\">\"The ride is rigid, comfortable, and fun.\"</div>\n<div class=\"question\">What would you improve about the build experience or your finished bike?</div>\n<div class=\"answer\">\"I would reinforce the bottle cage rivets before riding.</div>\n<div class=\"answer\" style=\"text-align: start;\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/IMG_0229_-_Stephane_Lhomel.jpg?v=1721053613\" style=\"float: none;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/IMG_0235_-_Stephane_Lhomel_480x480.jpg?v=1721053615\" alt=\"\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/IMG_0235_-_Stephane_Lhomel_480x480.jpg?v=1721053615\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/IMG_0230_-_Stephane_Lhomel_480x480.jpg?v=1721053615\" alt=\"\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/IMG_0230_-_Stephane_Lhomel_480x480.jpg?v=1721053615\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/IMG_0232_-_Stephane_Lhomel_480x480.jpg?v=1721053615\" alt=\"\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/IMG_0232_-_Stephane_Lhomel_480x480.jpg?v=1721053615\">\n</div>\n</div>",
